@startuml
title State Diagram - Plane Management

[*] --> Order : New acquisition

state Order
Order : entry / Receive plane details
Order : do / Update inventory and schedule
Order : exit / Transition to Arrival

Order --> Arrival : Delivery confirmed

state Arrival
Arrival : entry / Confirm arrival
Arrival : do / Check condition and schedule
Arrival --> Preparation : Schedule has flights or maintenance required

state Preparation
Preparation : entry / Prepare plane for operations
Preparation : do / Update inventory and schedule
Preparation --> Operations : Plane is ready for operations

state Operations
Operations : entry / Confirm operational status
Operations : do / Monitor scheduled flights and maintenance
Operations --> Maintenance : No more scheduled flights or maintenance required

state Maintenance
Maintenance : entry / Confirm maintenance status
Maintenance : do / Check and service plane
Maintenance --> Preparation : Plane is ready for preparation after maintenance

state "Plane Out of Service" as OutOfService
OutOfService : entry / Confirm plane is no longer available
OutOfService : exit / Remove from operations

state "Plane Withdrawn" as Withdrawn
Withdrawn : entry / Confirm permanent withdrawal
Withdrawn : exit / Remove from inventory and schedule

Order --> Arrival : Plane is delivered
Arrival --> Preparation : Schedule has flights or maintenance required
Preparation --> Operations : Plane is ready for operations
Operations --> Maintenance : No more scheduled flights or maintenance required
Maintenance --> Preparation : Plane is ready for preparation after maintenance
Operations --> OutOfService : Plane is no longer available
Withdrawn --> [*] : Plane is permanently withdrawn

@enduml
